    <p class="adt-body mb-8 text-left leading-relaxed text-neutral-800">
      <span data-id="pg084_n0006">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s s&#xeb; kat&#xeb;rt vizituan kryeqytetin e Kosov&#xeb;s, Prishtin&#xeb;n, s&#xeb; bashku me m&#xeb;suesen e tyre.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0007">Gjat&#xeb; kthimit p&#xeb;r n&#xeb; qytetin e tyre, f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t po bashk&#xeb;bisedonin me m&#xeb;suesen p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; vizituan.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0008">Secili f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; po tregonte se &#xe7;far&#xeb; i kishte b&#xeb;r&#xeb; p&#xeb;rshtypje.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0009">Rronit i kishte b&#xeb;r&#xeb; p&#xeb;rshtypje Teatri i Kukullave, sepse p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; koha aty ishte &#xe7;lodh&#xeb;se, e k&#xeb;ndshme dhe shum&#xeb; edukative.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0010">Alban&#xeb;s i kishte b&#xeb;r&#xeb; p&#xeb;rshtypje shum&#xeb; Muzeu i Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0011">Aty ajo kishte m&#xeb;suar m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; p&#xeb;r paraardh&#xeb;sit dhe historin&#xeb; e popullit ton&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0012">Bora ishte mahnitur nga arkitektura e Bibliotek&#xeb;s Komb&#xeb;tare dhe thoshte se mezi priste q&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;hej studente mjek&#xeb;sie e t&#xeb; lexonte aty.</span>
      <span data-id="pg084_n0013">P&#xeb;rshtypje f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve u kishte b&#xeb;r&#xeb; dhe Teatri Komb&#xeb;tar, Galeria e Arteve e vendet e tjera q&#xeb; i kishin vizituar shkurt, por p&#xeb;r secil&#xeb;n prej tyre kishin m&#xeb;suar di&#xe7;ka t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

